OL,3,ASpanish PM Sanchez loses key housing
OL,4,Acrisis vote after eviction of woman, 87
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpain's Congress has rejected a series
OL,7,Fof measures aimed at tackling the
OL,8,Fcountry's housing crisis, in a defeat
OL,9,Ffor the government of Pedro Sanchez
OL,10,Fthat increases pressure on him to call
OL,11,Fa snap election.
OL,13,FLawmakers voted on two decree-laws
OL,14,Fpresented by the government in response
OL,15,Fto nationwide protests that have
OL,16,Ffollowed the eviction of an 87-year-old
OL,17,Fwoman, Maricarmen Abascal, from her
OL,18,Fhome.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
