OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASpanish PM Sanchez loses key housing
OL,4,Acrisis vote after eviction of woman, 87
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decrees, which introduced a series
OL,7,Fof initiatives aimed at protecting
OL,8,Ftenants in the rental market, required
OL,9,Fparliamentary approval in order to
OL,10,Fremain in place.
OL,12,FMPs rejected the first decree by 178
OL,13,Fvotes to 172 and voted against the
OL,14,Fsecond by 184 to 166.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
